   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Now it's your turn—go ahead and grab one! </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The complete range of tool clamping systems is now available in our online store. Find the perfect tool holder in a simple, quick, and convenient manner, and use the digital twin available there immediately in your CAM and tool management system for its usage.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/shop/tooling\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Visit the Tooling Shop</a></p>",
   "images": [
